35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The wall is just plasterboard. I can hear everything.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We paid 68,000 yen last year for outside rooms. That is a lot.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. It is too long.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,The only talk happens by the printer now. It is not enough.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The two nearest the door used it eleven times. That is unfair.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, if we pay for outside rooms, we need a better inside one.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the quotes for fit-outs are high. We need to be careful.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, if we have a kitchen, we can eat here and talk.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, a kitchen might help, but we need a place for hard talks.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, a kitchen means more cleaning. Who does that?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,The crumbs are everywhere. A kitchen would make it worse.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The fridge clear-out was a mess. Half the food was old.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,I can clean up. I do not mind the work if we have a space.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,The awkward conversation happened in front of everyone. We need privacy.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The facilities callouts were high. A kitchen will add more.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
